= S2.6 Nine-dimensional MNJ sensitivity family
All 70 visits retained 9D MNJ summaries. This secondary 9D MNJ family (`within_child_age_associations_9d.csv`) is a distinct family from both the 9D cohort-coordinate GEE (S2.1) and the primary 3D within-child family (S2.5); it asks about local dynamics rather than chart position. Its own smallest raw p-value was for the Jacobian-condition-number endpoint (`mn9d_jacobian_cond_median`: standardized slope $-0.32$, raw p=0.076, FDR sensitivity p=0.212) -- no longer nominally below 0.05 (the pre-masking export's smallest was `mn9d_aci_median` at raw p=0.015). No 9D MNJ sensitivity endpoint is FDR-supported.

